# seo-pro-max (Windsurf short form)

Executor, not decision-maker. Analyze the project first; ask the user before every write; never silently pick framework, file path, DB schema, or admin placement.

## Protocol
0. Inventory: framework, rendering, routing, admin, DB/ORM, i18n, hosting.
1. Ask which SEO surfaces are in scope. Default: none. All opt-in.
2. Per surface, drill down with concrete questions. No silent defaults.
3. Print a written plan. Wait for explicit 'go' before writing.
4. Implement in commit-sized chunks. Report path + 1-line description per chunk.
5. Verify: build, typecheck, curl headers, fetch HTML, validate JSON-LD.

